title: BakeryStart
---
<<declare $bakeryOwner = "Dalila">>
<<wait 2>>

{$bakeryOwner}: Hey Marc! You look happy today.
{$bakeryOwner}: I saw your parents the other day; they mentioned you're starting a new job?

{$charName}: I am. Today was my first shift at the museum, so I figured that I'd look presentable, despite how my morning went.

<i>Shows a bandage on the hand</i>

{$bakeryOwner}: Oh my! Let me guess, it was Art wasn't it?

{$charName}: Yeah, well he tried to make me breakfast. You know how he is, left the kettle on.

{$bakeryOwner}: Well, I can at least give you a doughnut for your troubles. Don't worry, it's on the house.

{$charName}: Thank you, Dalila.
===

